  "scientific_review": [
    "All six declared Pacific SEC section/date cases at140,130,120W remain as two eastward primary-SSCC-context cases with three anchors each. Unselected,gate/support-edge or primary-censored cases remain explicit. Unsupported dated cases stay unresolved. Frozen adjacent-only interpolation never skips gaps or extrapolates;connectors are not measured current lengths.",
    "Declared before fields: order the three stops eastward and use only original native5.5–3S columns inside5.5–0.5S source slices. Exact subset-to-original mapping and raw-profile pointers remain. Historical poleward migration limits retained110/100W southern coverage;those stops are outside this declared partial reach rather than representing an inferred eastern continuation. New wider coverage requires a separately declared acquisition. Gates can still truncate main-jet meanders;secondary southern/northern/equatorial currents remain separate targets.",
    "Audit complete original current:pacific-south-equatorial sections with pinned270degree westward component,original selection and frozen geometry. Recompute90degree eastward velocity from raw u/v,keeping either missing component missing. New SSCC owner/frame is explicit;no original metadata,diagnosis,selection or numeric depth is relabeled or inherited. Family-level SEC receives no measurement.",
    "Frozen interval selection requires complete finite native100–400m support,positive signed integral and a core above10cm/s,with no surface gate. First southern native tie wins. Gate/support-edge maxima remain unresolved without weaker interior substitution. Selected5/10/20cm/s layers have their own qualifying seed at the same column. These diagnostics are neither confidence limits nor universal physical current edges.",
    "Fresh NOAA Johnson2002 text distinguishes main/secondary SSCC,other eastward currents and poleward/shoaling evolution. Fresh NOAA-hosted Rowe2000 primary text distinguishes primary and secondary jets,uneven historical archives and stream-coordinate methods. Mean core positions,PV/density fronts,ADCP domains and archives that may overlap do not validate2022 axes or establish paired physical boundaries. No source figures/field arrays copied or digitized.",
    "Neither100m nor400m truncates contour searches on the native0–5000m axis. Adjacent finite brackets resolve boundaries;missing/bed/domain support censors. Keep upper/lower depths,statuses,brackets,supported reach and paired span distinct. Same-sign neighboring flow can connect;geographic eastward maxima do not independently identify a coherent main branch. No thermal,salinity,density,PV or source-water classification is performed.",
    "Thin report retains candidate scores,selected diagnostics,original byte pins/indices and a separately typed selected90degree component. Raw-profile pointers target unchanged originals;derived vectors/layers target the report. This same-field reanalysis is not independent observational evidence. Unselected geometry uses the declared subset midpoint and is explicitly unsampled.",
    "Thirty-four cloud tests in groups12/10/12 cover frozen layer/interval math,source-to-inventory pipeline,opposite-frame recomputation,null handling,subset endpoints/raw-index mapping,subsurface flow with nonzero top and bottom below400m,definition/source/report mutations,original adjacency/gaps,input/piece/count integrity and unchanged caps. Six baseline tests passed on the exact code commit.",
    "Immutable v14 base,seventeen earlier addenda,all108 earlier scenarios,historical unresolved cases,old CSV cells and canonical reference ownership remain preserved. Prior auxiliary reports including WSC,AZCC and Atlantic SEUC remain pinned. Inventoryv18 adds one pinned addendum/CSV and thin report without rewriting original sources or frozen numerical helpers.",
    "All source audits,component/interval/contour math,geometry,interpolation,inventory reconstruction and tests ran sequentially in cloud on one idle CPU. Local work prepared code,reviewed primary text/metadata,checked hashes and retained exact artifacts. No new provider requests,local numerical field processing/tests or runtime/UI/browser work. Audit-plus-subset250000pair/7MB and publication caps are unchanged.",
    "This partial main-branch-context reach does not establish complete current thickness,eastern continuation,secondary-jet coverage,annual/seasonal envelopes,confidence bounds,matched area,physical volume,state intersections or global sums. Remaining identity/route coverage,observational/seasonal validation and query/runtime integration remain unfinished."
